    dcterms:identifier "Figure4.2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "(a) Conceptual diagram of how dispersal and niche ‘filters’ select species from pools at different geographical and ecological scales. (b) Main processes that directly or indirectly impact the filtering process (Modified from Thuiller et al., 2013. A road map for integrating eco-" .

