    skos:prefLabel "Schematic representation of a typical full-scale integrated assessment model. Red labels and arrows represent existing model components and interactions, while grey labels and greydashed arrows indicate important components and interactions not currently" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/SCM16-Figure4.7> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure4.7" ;
    skos:prefLabel "An overview of relationships between ecological theory, models, comparison and management. There may be numerous models to represent a given theory, and both the model comparisons and the management outcome may provide feedback to theory (Modified" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/SCM16-Figure4.8> a ipbes:Illustration ;
