    skos:prefLabel "Density of georeferenced species occurrence records published through GBIF up to December 2015. The top ten contributing countries of georeferenced data include the United States of America, Sweden, the United Kingdom, Australia, the Netherlands," .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/SCM16-Figure7.3> a ipbes:Illustration ;
