    dcterms:identifier "Figure7.4" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Example of biodiversity and ecosystem services scenarios linking biodiversity and ecosystem services with economy (focus on GDP and human well-being). Benefits to biodiversity and ecosystem services increase along the vertical axis; benefits to the economy increase along the horizontal axis." .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/SCM16-Figure7.5> a ipbes:Illustration ;
