        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/SCM16-8.2.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/SCM16-8.4.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Leadley, P.W., Krug, C.B., Alkemade, R., Pereira, H.M., Sumaila, U.R., Walpole, M., Marques, A., Newbold, T., Teh, L.S.L., Van Kolck, J., Bellard, C., Januchowski-Hartley, S.R. and Mumby, P.J., 2014: Progress towards the Aichi Biodiversity Targets: An Assessment of biodiversity Trends, Policy Scenarios and Key Actions. Secretariat of the Convention on Biological Diversity, Technical Series 78, Montreal, Canada." ;
