        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/SCM16-8.4.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Pereira, H.M., Leadley, P.W., Proenca, V., Alkemade, R., Scharlemann, J.P.W., Fernandez-Manjarres, J.F., Araújo, M.B., Balvanera, P., Biggs, R., Cheung, W.W.L., Chini, L., Cooper, H.D., Gilman, E.L., Guénette, S., Hurtt, G.C., Huntington, H.P., Mace, G.M., Oberdorff, T., Revenga, C., Rodrigues, P., Scholes, R.J., Sumaila, U.R. and Walpole, M., 2010: Scenarios for Global Biodiversity in the 21st Century. Science, 330(6010): 1496-1501." ;
